            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b15",
            "text": "To take the fragment of green material first, I found it caught in the bolt of the communicating door between that room and the adjoining one.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:28:31.346667+00:00"
          },
          {
