            "created_at": "2026-09-09T13:28:31.346686+00:00",
            "space_id": "semeval-terra-low-r1-b15",
            "text": "During this transport, over about 10 kilometres, the Herschel spacecraft was placed inside the payload transport container.",
            "title": "Relation benchmark excerpt",
            "updated_at": "2026-09-09T13:28:31.346686+00:00"
          },
          {
            "_id": "chunks/semeval-terra-low-r1-b15-semeval-10593",
